'''Pokémon Adventures: Mysterious Mew''' is the first monthly issue of the [[Pokémon Adventures]] manga to be released by [[VIZ Media]]. It contains the first three chapters of the {{MangaArc|Red, Green & Blue}}. The chapters originally released in this book were later compiled into {{PAV|1}}. As a bonus, it contained a sheet of Pokémon stickers which were not included with the collected volume release.

